                    block: period
                    description: is the limiting water level (head) in the well, which is the minimum of
                      the well RATE or the well inflow rate from the aquifer. HEAD_LIMIT can be applied
                      to extraction wells (RATE $<$ 0) or injection wells (RATE $>$ 0). HEAD_LIMIT can be
