                      with previous versions of MODFLOW but use of the RATE_SCALING option instead of the
                      HEAD_LIMIT option is recommended. By default, HEAD_LIMIT is `OFF'.
                    reader: urword
                    longname: head limit
                    type: string
                  shutoffrecord:
                    block: period
                    reader: urword
