                  leakage calculated using the specified stage exceeds the sum of inflows to the reach,
                  the stage is set to the top of the reach and leakage is set equal to the sum of inflows.
                  Upstream fractions should be changed using the UPSTREAM_FRACTION SFRSETTING if the status
